      "corrected_score": 3,
      "comment": "3. The agent did not hold the father's links for confirmation. It wrote a_004/a_006/a_007 to I1 at probable with the 0.58 score (pe_005, pe_008, pe_009), so the context line about holding links does not apply. All nine assertions are linked. The open item it reported (a stray \"Thomas [surname not indexed]\" name added to I1 when it materialized the father) is a side effect that belongs under Correctness, not unfinished scope."
